{
  "about": "Baseline SpotAnimRenderer digests, with the scoped overrides documented below, per encounter and preloaded effect: the baked parts (render state, positions, colors, alphas, face bias, uvs, texture ids, transparent-sort input) and every frame drawn on the skip-sort and full-sort transparent paths (the same attributes plus the model matrix). Normals are excluded. The regenerate command re-pins the baseline to what the renderer at --renderer-root draws.",
  "regenerate": "npx tsx src/render/scene/__tests__/encounterSpotAnimDraws.ts --renderer-root .",
